<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.draft.lifts ~ the count is the confirmation: pending kahua items lift under their faces' grants

`lift-kahua --count <n>` lifts the kahua items a lay previewed and left pending (`seed-mirrors.ts`): it runs the lay's mirror leg again and lifts only where `n` equals the count the preview reads now; a wrong count refuses and lifts nothing. `lares shore` names each pending item (face, title, body digest) beside its own rows, and a face standing shut names the unlock to run first (`lares vault unlock --face N`). The count IS the confirmation, so the verb asks nothing more, and it reads no face (`--face` refuses as usage).

`lares kahua lift` lifts one staged row by its title and digest (`face.hand.lifts`); this address lifts the pending set a lay left, by count. The two read one verb word and differ in what they take and what they lift: a title and its row digest against a count, one staged row in the face's local canon against every item the lay's mirror leg previewed, so each holds its own address.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ lift-the-count

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`lift-the-count` params=`count/2 ~ lift the two pending items the preview named`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ count

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`count` params=`takes/number needs/required ~ the count of pending kahua items lares shore lists; a wrong count lifts nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face-grant ~ each lift signs under its face's own grant; a person runs it at their own terminal, wearing the face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · count-moved

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[carriage.draft.lifts count/<n>]] ~ lift-kahua names the count of pending kahua items: lares shore lift-kahua --count <n>`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`count-moved` params=`~ the count no longer equals the preview's; nothing lifted, and a new lares shore names the count that stands`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ lifted · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`lifted` params=`exit/0 ~ the pending items lifted under their faces' grants`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`~ the mirror leg refused by name; nothing lifted`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

